== Acceptance criteria ==

Wave 11 is ready to leave Phase 3 when:

# all 63 reader surfaces remain present;
# Token/Oracle title qualification remains intact;
# one concept = one Core semantic identity;
# controlled Domains pass;
# cryptography remains broader than blockchain;
# blockchain/distributed-ledger and smart-contract/legal-contract distinctions remain explicit;
# wallet/key and identity/DID boundaries remain explicit;
# AMM/pool, slippage/price-impact, oracle/truth, attestation/truth distinctions remain explicit;
# derivatives remain category/identity-exempt;
# complete V2 release gates and staging pass.

